Follow whatever pattern you find in the neighboring tests. For a bare `fetch`, `vi.stubGlobal("fetch", ...)` (Vitest) or `jest.spyOn(global, "fetch")` in `beforeEach` — still at the network boundary, and cleaned up in `afterEach`.

