| MSW handlers shared across tests | `src/mocks/handlers.ts`, registered in setup |
| One-off error/edge response for a single test | inline in the test file via `server.use(...)` |
| Project uses fetch-spy or client-module mocking | alongside the existing pattern you found in a neighboring test |

